          'site.fp.evidence.ans1': 'No. Once the report is sent for review, photos are locked: their time, place and who took them can’t change. A manager can still add notes.',
          'site.fp.evidence.q2': 'Do photos use a lot of mobile data?',
          'site.fp.evidence.ans2': 'No. Photos are made smaller on the phone before they are sent, so a job uses little data.',
          'site.fp.evidence.q3': 'What happens if there is no signal on site?',
          'site.fp.evidence.ans3': 'Keep working. Photos wait on the phone and are sent once you are back online — each one only once.',
          'site.fp.evidence.q4': 'Can customers see the photos?',
          'site.fp.evidence.ans4': 'Yes, the ones in the approved report. Customers get a copy without the location data hidden in the file.',
          'site.fp.evidence.cta': 'Give every job its photo proof',
          'site.fp.checklists.name': 'Checklists',
          'site.fp.checklists.card': 'Ready templates, answered on site with one tap.',
          'site.fp.checklists.title': 'Checklists your team actually finishes',
          'site.fp.checklists.body': 'Start from a ready template or build your own, ask for photos where they matter, and let technicians answer with one tap — in their own language. Every answer goes straight into the report.',
