          'site.fp.checklists.cap_title': 'Simple for technicians, complete for managers',
          'site.fp.checklists.cap_body': 'Every visit follows the same steps — and nothing gets skipped.',
          'site.fp.checklists.c1': 'Ready templates',
          'site.fp.checklists.c1_b': 'KaamNishaan checklists are ready on day one. Copy one to make it your own.',
          'site.fp.checklists.c2': 'Photo rules',
          'site.fp.checklists.c2_b': 'Ask for a photo every time, or only when the answer is No or Fail.',
          'site.fp.checklists.tag': 'Required',
          'site.fp.checklists.c3': 'The right kind of answer',
          'site.fp.checklists.c3_b': 'Yes / No, Pass / Fail, a number with its unit, a few words or a photo.',
          'site.fp.checklists.c4': 'One question at a time',
          'site.fp.checklists.c4_b': 'Large text and buttons that are easy to use on a roof or in bright sun.',
          'site.fp.checklists.c5': 'In the technician’s language',
          'site.fp.checklists.c5_b': 'KaamNishaan’s ready checklists come in English, Hindi, Gujarati, Spanish and French.',
