          'site.fp.checklists.use_title': 'Checklists for every trade',
          'site.fp.checklists.use_body': 'See which trades have ready checklists today. For the others, build your own in minutes.',
          'site.fp.checklists.q1': 'Can I edit the ready templates?',
          'site.fp.checklists.ans1': 'Yes. Copy a KaamNishaan checklist, then change, reorder or remove any question and add your own. Your copy is saved for your team.',
          'site.fp.checklists.q2': 'Which trades have ready checklists?',
          'site.fp.checklists.ans2': 'The list above shows it live. HVAC comes first; more trades are being added. Any team can build its own checklist today.',
          'site.fp.checklists.q3': 'What if I change a checklist while jobs are running?',
          'site.fp.checklists.ans3': 'Running jobs keep the questions they started with. Your change applies to new jobs.',
          'site.fp.checklists.q4': 'Do checklist answers show in the report?',
          'site.fp.checklists.ans4': 'Yes. The customer sees each answer and reading, with the photos taken for it.',
