          'site.fp.voice.chip2': 'Written down',
          'site.fp.voice.chip2_sub': 'Original recording kept',
          'site.fp.voice.how_title': 'How voice notes work',
          'site.fp.voice.how_body': 'Four steps from a spoken note to a clear line in the report.',
          'site.fp.voice.s1': 'Tap and speak',
          'site.fp.voice.s1_b': 'Press the big mic button and say what you did, in your own words.',
          'site.fp.voice.s2': 'Any of 5 languages',
          'site.fp.voice.s2_b': 'Hindi, Gujarati, Spanish, French or English. The language is found for you.',
          'site.fp.voice.s3': 'Written down',
          'site.fp.voice.s3_b': 'The note is written down word for word. You can fix a word if needed.',
          'site.fp.voice.s4': 'Into the report',
          'site.fp.voice.s4_b': 'The AI report uses it, and the manager can play the original recording.',
          'site.fp.voice.cap_title': 'Built for people who would rather talk than type',
          'site.fp.voice.cap_body': 'The fastest way to record what happened on site.',
          'site.fp.voice.c1': 'Speak in your language',
          'site.fp.voice.c1_b': 'Technicians talk the way they normally do. No spelling, no typing.',
          'site.fp.voice.c2': 'Recording always kept',
          'site.fp.voice.c2_b': 'The original audio stays with the job, next to the written version, and is never changed.',
          'site.fp.voice.tag': 'Original kept',
          'site.fp.voice.c3': 'Word for word',
          'site.fp.voice.c3_b': 'What was said is written down as it was said. The AI report turns it into clear sentences.',
          'site.fp.voice.c4': 'Report in the customer’s language',
          'site.fp.voice.c4_b': 'Speak Gujarati, send English — or any of the 5 languages.',
          'site.fp.voice.c5': 'Speak to change',
          'site.fp.voice.c5_b': 'Missed something? Record again. The earlier note stays until you delete it.',
          'site.fp.voice.c6': 'Works offline',
          'site.fp.voice.c6_b': 'Record with no signal. The note is saved on the phone and sent when you are back online.',
          'site.fp.voice.app_title': 'Speak Gujarati. Send English.',
          'site.fp.voice.app_body': 'Ramesh speaks Gujarati on site. The AI drafts the report in English from his voice note and photos.',
          'site.fp.voice.use_title': 'Voice notes for every trade',
          'site.fp.voice.use_body': 'Hands busy or gloves on? Say it instead of typing it.',
          'site.fp.voice.q1': 'Which languages can technicians speak in?',
          'site.fp.voice.ans1': 'English, Hindi, Gujarati, Spanish and French. They can pick the language before recording, or let KaamNishaan find it.',
          'site.fp.voice.q2': 'Is the original recording kept?',
          'site.fp.voice.ans2': 'Yes. The audio is part of the job’s proof. It is never changed, and managers can play it next to the written version.',
          'site.fp.voice.q3': 'Can I correct what was written down?',
          'site.fp.voice.ans3': 'Yes. Fix any word in the written version. The recording itself stays as it was.',
          'site.fp.voice.q4': 'How long can a voice note be?',
          'site.fp.voice.ans4': 'Up to 10 minutes. Most notes are under a minute. You can record more than one note per job.',
          'site.fp.voice.cta': 'Let your team speak their language',
          'site.fp.reports.name': 'AI reports',
          'site.fp.reports.card': 'Drafted from real proof. Never invents work.',
          'site.fp.reports.title': 'Reports that write themselves — from real proof',
          'site.fp.reports.body': 'KaamNishaan AI turns the photos, checklist answers and voice notes from a job into a clear, customer-ready report. Every sentence links back to its proof, and nothing is sent until a manager approves.',
          'site.fp.reports.tick1': 'Never invents work',
