          'site.fp.reports.app_body': 'Ramesh speaks Gujarati on site. The AI drafts the report in English, linked to his photos and checklist answers.',
          'site.fp.reports.use_title': 'AI reports for every trade',
          'site.fp.reports.use_body': 'The report is written from the job’s own proof, whatever the work.',
          'site.fp.reports.q1': 'Can the AI invent work that wasn’t done?',
          'site.fp.reports.ans1': 'No. The draft only describes what is in the job’s photos, checklist answers and voice notes. Every sentence links to its proof, and a manager approves the report before the customer sees it.',
          'site.fp.reports.q2': 'Which languages can reports be written in?',
          'site.fp.reports.ans2': 'English, Hindi, Gujarati, Spanish and French. The technician can speak one language and the customer can read another.',
          'site.fp.reports.q3': 'Can I edit the draft before it’s sent?',
          'site.fp.reports.ans3': 'Yes. The technician can change any part before sending it for review, and the manager can ask for changes before approving.',
          'site.fp.reports.q4': 'Do AI reports cost extra?',
          'site.fp.reports.ans4': 'No. AI reports are included on every plan. Plans differ in how many reports you can make each month.',
          'site.fp.reports.cta': 'Let AI write your next report',
