          'site.fp.sharing.q1': 'Do customers need to download an app?',
          'site.fp.sharing.ans1': 'No. The report opens in any phone or computer browser. There is nothing to install and no account to create.',
          'site.fp.sharing.q2': 'What happens when a link expires?',
          'site.fp.sharing.ans2': 'The customer can ask for a new one. It is sent only to the phone or email the report first went to, never to whoever asks.',
          'site.fp.sharing.q3': 'Can I see if the customer opened the report?',
          'site.fp.sharing.ans3': 'Yes. The job shows when the link was first opened and when the customer acknowledged it.',
          'site.fp.sharing.q4': 'Can a link be turned off?',
          'site.fp.sharing.ans4': 'Yes. Turn it off at any time and it stops working straight away. Sharing again makes a new link.',
          'site.fp.sharing.cta': 'Send proof your customers can open anywhere',
          'site.fp.offline.name': 'Offline mode',
