          'site.fp.offline.use_title': 'Offline for every trade',
          'site.fp.offline.use_body': 'Built for the places field teams actually work.',
          'site.fp.offline.q1': 'Can anything be sent twice?',
          'site.fp.offline.ans1': 'No. Each item has its own tag, so even if the signal drops in the middle of sending, the server keeps only one copy.',
          'site.fp.offline.q2': 'What if the phone restarts before it sends?',
          'site.fp.offline.ans2': 'Your work is still there. The queue is kept on the phone and continues when the app opens again.',
          'site.fp.offline.q3': 'Do voice notes work offline too?',
          'site.fp.offline.ans3': 'Yes. The recording is saved on the phone and written down after it is sent.',
