          'site.fp.reviews.c1': 'Rate from the report',
          'site.fp.reviews.c1_b': 'Customers see the proof first — photos, checklist, work done — then rate the service and the technician, with quick tags and a few words.',
          'site.fp.reviews.c2': 'Smart reminders',
          'site.fp.reviews.c2_b': 'One reminder on the channels you pick. Never after they rate, never after they opt out.',
