          'site.about.why_title': 'Simple tools for every field worker',
          'site.about.why_body': 'Whatever their reading level, and whatever language they speak.',
          'site.about.why_p1': 'Most field software is built for office staff. It expects long forms, perfect spelling and English.',
          'site.about.why_p2': 'But the people doing the work — technicians, installers, cleaners — are often more comfortable speaking than typing, and many prefer their own language.',
          'site.about.why_p3': 'So we built KaamNishaan voice-first: big buttons, one question at a time, and voice notes in English, Hindi, Gujarati, Spanish or French. The app turns what they say and photograph into a report the customer can trust.',
          'site.about.why_caption': 'The people we build for · illustrative photos, not real staff',
