          'site.about.v1_b': 'If you can use WhatsApp, you can use KaamNishaan. Big buttons, few words, one step at a time.',
          'site.about.v2': 'Honest AI',
          'site.about.v2_b': 'AI never invents work. Every sentence links to a photo, an answer or a voice note.',
          'site.about.v3': 'Your language',
          'site.about.v3_b': 'Workers speak their own language. Reports go out in the customer’s.',
          'site.about.v4': 'Proof protects everyone',
